stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Current: ingest<br/>version 1
    Current --> Current: ingest changed content<br/>new version, older objects retired
    Current --> Tombstone: delete<br/>hidden at once
    Tombstone --> Current: ingest again<br/>revived
    Tombstone --> Erased: purge(ids), or purge_after<br/>once every unit marked it deleted
    Current --> Erased: purge(ids)
    Erased --> [*]

    note right of Current
        Retention keeps the newest max_versions
        versions and events for event_retention.
    end note
    note right of Erased
        Every metadata row is deleted.
        Other engines evict the objects
        through the purge log.
    end note
